Z||000000||fierolarry||05-10-2001||06:03 AM||||My 87 GT is having an intermittant problem . When driving the car on two occassions has stalled out when i let up on the gas at stop sign. The car will then start right back up  and run fine until i put in drive or reverse anr then it will stall out immerdiately. After the car cools off for some time the car then works fine. this has happened twice to me now. anyone have a clue. It doesnt seem to be the lock-up sol;enoid from what my mecanic says. Thanks.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Old Lar||05-10-2001||07:31 AM||||Sounds like the torque converter solinoid. Transmission locked up in 3rd, stalls when put into gear, cools down and unlocks. You can start and drive away, gets warm locks up and stalls at a light.  You can disconnect the wire to the solinoid and lose the lock up feature.<P>Those were my symptoms.||||reg||1
